# HOOPLA: each fighter has an ending of its own; GULP in his second colours
# gets a note after his. Then the credits, and back to the title.
seed 26
game hoopla
wait 30
cheat tourney 0 0
wait 25
press A
waituntil state == 6 200
cheat winmatch
wait 2
wait 25
press A
waituntil state == 6 200
cheat winmatch
